canon = "Ch6 (Keeper 2026-11-01, [C]): Alis (brass bird mask) bathes her and cuts her hair; she sits in a white dressing gown; refuses the velvet turquoise dress; her old shirt and pants fell apart in the wash; Alis brings trousers and a tunic that fit: white shirt, dark blue tunic, scratchy golden thread on the lapels. Wording of the spoken lines is invented (X). Marks are in feyre_bedroom_window's frame (anchor at world 23, level 1, -70.4); the bath station is at world (32.4, -57.8). Outfit: closest wardrobe pieces spring_tunic_sky + spring_trousers_cream until a navy-and-gold tunic piece exists."
